    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 活化生物（构装体，造妖）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 38；''重伤'' 19</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 14</span><span>''侦查'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 疾病，毒素</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">守护生物</div>\n<div class=description>石拳防御者的攻击骰对任何邻接其守护生物的敌人获得+2 加值（参照“守护”边栏）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">同步夹击</div>\n<div class=description>在该石拳防御者与其守护生物对一个敌人构成夹击时，它的攻击对这个被夹击的敌人造成<br>1d6 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}刺拳✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+7 vs. AC<br>命中：1d8+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">翻滚✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>该石拳防御者快步 3 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 12（+2）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 17（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 11（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 7（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
